WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.208
CLEAN. Show an adult wiping a dirty but blunt tool.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.781
STORE. Show tools placed in a dry cabinet.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.613
MAINTAIN. Show an adult putting a drop of oil on a metal hinge.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.183
SAFE. Show protected storage of sharp tools out of child reach.
